jd:
We are looking for a React developer to develop a new SaaS solution from scratch. You can read more below.

**Project description:**

Participate is the development of a new Saas solution:

The Saas solution allows to contractors (from the roofting industry) to embed the front end part of the solution to their websites to make the process of selecting and buying roofs simple as buying a smartphone online.
So it consists of
widget, the frontend part of the application that is installed on other companies' websites
an administrative dashboard that allows to manage widget and work with data collected from users (people who want roof replacement)
MVP of the app is already launched, plus a couple of releases after that, but there are more big features are in the future.

**Support existing Roofle Web Application:**

For roof purchasers who have a general understanding of the roofing business and need to find a new roof for installation or replacement, the Roofle Application is a web system that allows roofing sale completely online. The Roofle Application provides access to the Roofing Catalog. The Roofle Application contains roofing products of different brands, types, colors, and grades. Furthermore, the roof purchaser is able to compare the roof products, get a range of recommended products of different brands and inventors, as well as to get information about prices and financing.
Unlike actual similar services, the Roofle Application has wholly automated the process of purchasing a new roof for installation or replacement, as well as handled the whole logistics of a roof purchasing process, thus, excluding person-to-person meetings with the end customers before placing an order for a roof and making the whole roof purchasing process more straightforward.

**Technologies:**

● Main stack: React, Redux, TypeScript, JavaScript
● Js stack for services and API
● Server-side rendering experience, SEO
● AWS
● AWS RDS, Lambdas, Containers, S3
● Version Control System: GIT on customer GitHub account.
● CI/CD: AWS CodePipline, CodeBuild. CodeDeploy


**Requirements:**

● 5+ years experience in building modern and performant frontend applications with React;
● Strong experience using TypeScript/Node.JS;
● Strong communication skills (written and verbal);
● Strong SQL skills are nice to have;
● Strong understanding of basic algorithms and data structures;
● Proven knowledge of commonly used software concepts, practices and methodologies;
● Advanced English speaking and writing knowledge.

**Responsibilities:**

● Work within the team to develop web application from scratch;
● Propose improvements to Increase the reliability of the product;
● Cover your code with the unit tests to improve quality;
● Review pull requests and provide feedback;

**We offer you:**

● Reliable people-oriented company;
● A strong team of professionals, friendly and open to cooperation;
● Opportunity to share experiences at internal meetings and conferences;
● 100+ technical and non-technical training for development and broadening of horizons;
● Career growth and development;
● Regular salary review based on employee performance;
● Medical insurance from the first working day;
● 15 sick leave are fully compensated;
● 18 working days of paid leave;
● IT Club Loyalty program gives a lot of discounts and bonuses;
● English courses;
● Remote work;
● Team sports activities and corporate events.

**Get to know us via video and send your CV.**

