We invite a self-motivated, experienced and independent QA Engineer who has excellent communication skills and enjoys collaborating with a team.

**About**
Our client delivers innovative products and experiences to mobile advertisers and publishers. As a leading monetization and mediation platform, our client works with today’s most successful publishers and advertisers to help elevate the mobile economy in a user-friendly and positive way.

**Responsibilities:**
Work in a cross-functional team together with Android developers and iOS engineers to design, implement and release new features in the SDK;
Review requirements, specifications and technical design documents to provide timely and meaningful feedback;
Create detailed, comprehensive and well-structured test plans and test cases;
Estimate, prioritize, plan and coordinate testing activities;
Identify, record, document thoroughly and track bugs;
Perform thorough regression testing when bugs are resolved;
Develop and apply testing processes for new and existing products to meet client needs;
Track quality assurance metrics;
Stay up-to-date with new testing tools and test strategies;
Gain knowledge on a variety of cutting-edge technologies as you maintain software that is used by a hundred million users every day.

**Requirements:**
4+ years of experience in software quality assurance;
Proven work experience in software quality assurance of mobile applications;
Strong knowledge of software QA methodologies, tools and processes;
Experience in writing clear, concise and comprehensive test plans and test cases;
Hands-on experience with both white box and black box testing;
Solid knowledge of SQL and scripting;
Experience working in an Agile/Scrum development process;
At least Upper-Intermediate level of spoken and written English;
BS/MS degree in Computer Science, Engineering or a related subject.

**Would be a plus:**
Hands-on experience with automated testing tools;
Experience in testing Android applications;
Strong knowledge and experience with Java;
Experience with performance and/or security testing is a plus.

