Arenarts Studio, an American gaming startup with a Ukrainian team on board, is looking for a talented Mobile games 3D artist to join our company and new project — Rovilon.

We are developing a sci-fi P2P third-person multiplayer online shooter for iOS and Android mobile devices. The ideal candidate will have at least 2 years of experience in 3D art and a strong portfolio demonstrating their expertise in hard-surface modeling, rigging, animation, and texturing.

**Responsibilities:**

- Create 3D characters and environment objects from concept to completion;
- Rig and animate characters;
- Model low-poly assets and perform retopology for optimal performance in UE5;
- Create and bake textures;
- Generate texture atlases for efficient use in UE5;
- Collaborate with the design and development teams to ensure the artistic vision is realized.

**Requirements:**

- At least 2 years of experience in 3D art;
- Strong knowledge of Blender, 3ds Max, or similar 3D software;
- Experience in hard-surface modeling and mecha design;
- Proficiency in low-poly modeling and retopology;
- Rigging and animation skills;
- Experience in texturing and baking textures;
- Ability to create texture atlases;
- Intermediate English.

**What we offer:**

- Remote work with flexible hours;
- The opportunity to be part of a passionate and talented team working on an innovative project;
- Professional growth and development opportunities;
- Creative freedom and the ability to make a meaningful impact on the game;
- A supportive and collaborative work environment.

