Cloudfresh⛅️ is a global Google Cloud Premier Partner, Zendesk Premier Partner, Asana Solutions Partner, and GitLab Select Partner.

Since 2017, we've specialized in implementation, migration, integration, audit, administration, support, and training for the best-in-class cloud solutions. We're into products for cutting-edge cloud computing, unique location and mapping, seamless collaboration from anywhere, peerless customer service, and innovative DevSecOps.

Currently, we’re looking for an outreach specialist responsible for finding ways to generate more backlinks for a company's website, thus strengthening our SEO process.

WHAT YOU SHOULD HAVE:
- At least one year of experience in white-hat link building and guest posting;
- At least an Upper-Intermediate level of English;
- Strong understanding of Outreach/Link building strategies;
- Basic knowledge of SEO principles;
- Proficiency in Google Docs and Google Sheets;
- Basic HTML knowledge;
- Experience working with Ahrefs, Search Console, Google Analytics, and similar SEO tools.

WHAT YOU WILL BE DOING:
- Search for relevant quality websites where to publish guest posts and sponsored posts;
- Competitors backlink profile analysis and monitoring;
- Contact webmasters, editors, and bloggers to place links;
- Search for outsource copywriters;
- Generate topic ideas, create and set tasks for copywriters;
- Monitor published backlinks quality and indexing;
- Take part in different content marketing activities;
- Create reports on outreach and link-building performance regularly;
- Generate new outreach ideas and link-building strategies;
- Find copywriting agencies or freelancer content writers, if necessary.

As a plus:
- Copywriting skills
- Additional foreign language

WHAT WE OFFER:
- Remote first;
- An opportunity to work with the world’s best products from Google, Zendesk, Asana, and Gitlab;
- The competitive salary level with a timely payment without delays every month;
- Transparent bonus system;
- Official employment under the Labor Code, vacation, and sick leave;
- Flexible and hybrid working hours: 9:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. or 10:00 a.m. to 7:00 p.m.;
- Educational sponsorship (various educational opportunities, e.g., courses, conferences, meet-ups, etc., are sponsored by the company).

