## Ideal Candidate Profile
Highly motivated and experienced backend developer with over two years of expertise in Ruby and Rails, adept at crafting robust and scalable solutions. Proficient in object-oriented programming and test-driven development, I excel at analyzing complex systems, identifying and resolving bugs, and automating repetitive tasks. My background includes building and consuming APIs, working with relational databases such as Postgres, and contributing to codebases within a Git workflow. Eager to leverage my skills to enhance Cobot's backend systems and improve the overall user experience.

