Accellabs is an IT outsourcing company that has been successfully providing a full cycle of complex development for 10 years. Now we are developing a digital marketing branch that helps to grow our client’s brands. We started digital marketing because we believe that this direction has a great future. Like in IT, in marketing, we provide high-quality services and build long-term strong relationships with our clients.

We are looking for a Digital Marketing Manager who will apply past experience in the management of our marketing team. Our ideal candidate has strong leadership skills, good knowledge of different digital marketing instruments and experience in the successful promotion of offline and online client's businesses.

**You will:**
- Developing and set-up the implementation of marketing strategies based on market research and client’s needs;
- Management of different branches of Marketing Department: SEO, SMM, e-mail marketing, PPC etc;
- Communicate with customers to collect requirements, advice on decisions and set delivery expectations;
- Brainstorm strategy, content, be creative and come up with marketing promotion solutions; 
- Develop user engagement scenarios and create various automation campaigns and flows based on those scenarios;
- Set up analytics and measure performance based on KPI set.

**Your daily tasks would include:**
- Content strategy planning;
- Formation of technical specifications for designers and content writers, checking the results and issuing assignments for making edits;
- Planning and implementation campaigns, performance evaluation of it;
- Tracking campaign performance and making operational decisions on changing strategies.

**Requirements:**
- 2,5+ years experience in Digital Marketing in a similar position;
- Good knowledge of marketing tools: Google Analytics, Semrush, Similarweb, Heepsy, Ads Managers, Google Ads, Programmatic platforms, etc;
- Good understanding of SEO, the experience of close work with SEO specialists, setting tasks and monitoring implementation;
- Experience in e-mail marketing. Understanding SPF, DKIM, DMARC, POST-Master, creating trigger letter chains;
- Following current trends in the development of SMM strategy, the experience of cooperation with SMM managers of freelancers to set up goals and check the results;
- Ability to independently customize Instagram / Facebook / LinkedIn marketing campaigns;
- Fluent speaking or a close level of English is a must;
- Ability to make operational decisions and work with a large amount of information;
- Successful cases of brand promotion - real examples.

**Our hiring process includes:**
-HR-interview with a recruiter: receiving more details about the position, team, our customers, HR procedures and policies;
- Online interview with Head of marketing: hard skills checking;
- Final meeting with a team.

**What we offer:**
- Amazing opportunities for professional growth within a top-notch team of professionals;
- Remote or office (5 min from Pecherskaya metro station);
- Flexible working hours: 9:00-19:00 we do not work after 19:00;
- No overtime — healthy work-life balance;
- Transparent and convenient manual time tracking (no additional software);
- No rush — we thoroughly plan our work;
- No limit to vacation;
- Top Medical insurance;
- SportLife program compensation;
- Full financial and legal support for private entrepreneurs.

