Luxoft is proud to offer the exciting opportunity to work on an internal solution for Autonomous Driving cars industry.

Autonomous driving is a significant challenge for scientists, developers, the automotive industry, and humanity in general. This technology influences real changes in the world; it can affect our attitude to private property, free up the time that we spend driving and speed up travel. It is a prime chance to change the world and bring driving safety to the next step in its evolution.

A huge amount of real recorded data from the car required to provide an appropriate level of testing ADAS / AD functionality. We are going to deliver end-to-end simulation capabilities for functional development by providing photorealistic 3D environments, traffic agents, ready-to-use scenarios and scenario alternation mechanisms, pre-defined sensor models and services to develop the proprietary ones.

We are working on an internal solution, which is going to become a part of a bigger platform for Autonomous Driving level 4/5 functions development.

**Responsibilities:**
- Work in Scrum team with a friendly spirit;
- Support CI/CD/CT processes and activities;
- Support development and testing team in requests;
- Proactively propose better solutions to fit the business needs if identified in the analysis stage.

