- Understanding of SW development and testing processes;
- Strong system administration skills;
- Strong skills of Continuous Integration / Delivery / Testing Management;
- Cloud solutions experience (Azure);
- Linux/UNIX system knowledge;
- Bash Shell Scripting;
- Python Programming;
- System Virtualization and Containers (Docker),
- Jenkins;
- Git / GitHub Flow;
- Networking;
- Microservices;
- Kubernetes or similar;
- Ansible scripting;
- Problem-solving / Troubleshooting;
- Open communications (written / spoken);
- English (Intermediate level).

**Nice-to-Have Skills:**
- Nginx;
- JIRA/BitBucket/Confluence/Bamboo;
- Terraform;
- Hadoop.

