Highly experienced DevOps Engineer with over 2 years of expertise in designing, deploying, and supporting web application infrastructures on AWS. Proficient in utilizing CloudFormation to automate AWS deployments and possesses a strong understanding of core AWS services, security controls, and the Well-Architected Framework. Proven ability to build and administer web application environments using Linux, bash, and Ansible, coupled with knowledge of programming languages such as Python and JavaScript, ensures the delivery of highly available, scalable, and secure cloud solutions. Adept at managing database engines and driving continuous improvement through DevOps best practices.

