Highly skilled Data Engineer with 3+ years of experience specializing in building cloud application integration processes and ETL workflows. Proficient in utilizing Informatica Cloud Services to design and implement both real-time and batch integration applications, particularly with REST APIs and various data sources including Salesforce and RDBMS. Adept at working with Azure and possessing a strong understanding of database management systems, I excel at migrating existing solutions to IICS and collaborating with clients to develop effective integration strategies. My expertise ensures seamless data connectivity and efficient data processing for critical business operations.

