Build new services and functionality, manage technical debt, be on the lookout for opportunities for platform improvement, and work with system engineers to increase the scale of our production systems;
Define technical requirements and solutions and drive projects through to completion;
Work with product, tech, and business leaders to determine the roadmap and deliverables;
Work within a geographically distributed team of developers in both the US and Europe;
Actively contribute to the adoption of strong software architecture, software development lifecycle best practices, and new technologies;
Growth: mentor junior engineers, and teach industry-wide best practices;
Actively participate in all phases of the SDLC including analysis, design, development, testing and implementation.
