5+ years experience building and maintaining production websites;
5+ years working with Python;
Data structures, design patterns, and algorithms;
Participation in the development of large projects;
Relational Databases;
Django, REST Framework hands on experience;
Experience with git;
Comfortable taking the lead on projects and working without lots of oversight;
Experience maintaining and improving existing software, including testing and refactoring;
Computer Science or related technical field university degree;
English – Intermediate +
NICE TO HAVE:
JS, CSS, jQuery, React experience;
History of successful projects working with AWS or Heroku;
History of work on enterprise quality projects.
WE OFFER:
Excellent compensation;
Flexible work schedule;
Events + team activities;
Exciting growth opportunity as Sailo expands its product line and enters new markets.

