As a Digital Marketing Specialist with SEO skills, you will play a crucial role in developing and implementing effective digital marketing strategies to optimize our online presence and drive traffic, engagement, and conversions. You will be responsible for executing and refining SEO campaigns, monitoring analytics, managing social media platforms, and staying up-to-date with the latest industry trends and best practices.

**Benefits:**
- enjoy a generous paid vacation package of 4 weeks per year, allowing you to recharge and explore new horizons;
- benefit from the convenience of receiving your salary in 2 installments each month, ensuring financial stability and flexibility;
- embrace a healthy work-life balance with flexible working hours, enabling you to align your professional and personal commitments seamlessly;
- rest easy knowing that your well-being is a priority with comprehensive medical insurance coverage;
- nurture your professional growth with the support of Launch Labs, as we cover additional expenses for professional courses and training, empowering you to stay ahead of the curve;
- join a vibrant and dynamic team of young professionals, fostering an environment of enthusiasm, collaboration, and innovative thinking;
- experience the freedom of remote work, allowing you to work from the comfort of your preferred location, wherever that may be;
- immerse yourself in a friendly atmosphere built on trust, where we value and respect our colleagues;
- we believe in fostering a positive work environment without the need for intrusive time trackers or surveillance.

**Responsibilities:**
- develop and execute comprehensive digital marketing strategies, including SEO, social media, and email marketing to enhance brand visibility and achieve business objectives.
- conduct thorough keyword research and analysis to identify opportunities for organic traffic growth and develop SEO-focused content strategies.
- optimize website structure, content, and landing pages to improve organic search rankings and enhance the overall user experience.
- monitor and analyze website performance using tools like Google Analytics, Google Search Console, and others to identify areas for improvement and implement necessary changes;
- stay updated with the latest trends, algorithms, and best practices in SEO, search engine marketing (SEM), social media marketing, and other digital marketing disciplinesж
- сollaborate with cross-functional teams, including the content creator, the SMM specialist, and the designer to ensure seamless implementation of digital marketing campaigns.

**Requirements:**
- proven work experience as a Digital Marketing Specialist with a strong focus on SEO;
- in-depth knowledge of search engine algorithms, and SEO best practices;
- experience in using SEO tools such as Google Analytics, Google Search Console;
- hands-on experience with social media platforms and their respective advertising and analytics tools;
- excellent written and verbal communication skills;
- creative mindset with a keen eye for detail and the ability to think outside the box.

**Nice-to-haves:**
- understanding of American culture 
- experience in sales activities in the US

